#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:4 2599ac2b1ebc45c49afaaea9bbb9bb6b
msgid "查看平台通知"
msgstr "View Platform Notifications"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:7 3fd0f87c23024ffcb11ccb5a44f81522
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:9 5b6cfafd0f1b4bae86d2faaddef91241
msgid "帮助用户及时发现系统通知和重要消息。"
msgstr ""
"Help users discover system notifications and important messages in time."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:12 e39493ba566644fdb410d30e0084f734
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to Access"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:14 965a36d435224a6b957e9f797c1bf3bb
msgid "普通用户侧栏没有 ``通知中心`` 菜单。可通过以下方式进入："
msgstr ""
"Regular users do not have a ``Notification Center`` item in the sidebar. "
"Access it as follows:"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:16 f0280f3df37e42049def4e9d5d57c1f2
msgid "工作台 ``快捷操作`` 中的 ``通知中心`` 按钮（路径 通知中心页面）。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Notification Center`` button under ``Quick Actions`` on the workbench "
"(Notification Center page)."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:18 1648f0ac7c5d4aa09225c224eb302132
msgid "工作台 ``平台通知`` 卡片右上角的 ``查看全部`` 链接。"
msgstr ""
"The ``View All`` link at the top right of the ``Platform Notifications`` "
"card on the workbench."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:21 54a68db23e9b4efc96a542dce6a47f87
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page Contents"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:23 53168c520bfd4833b5e8c5a640227da7
msgid ""
"通知中心页面顶部显示四个统计：``全部通知``、``未读通知``、``重要通 知``、``重要``。下方是筛选条件 ``类型`` ``分类`` "
"``状态``。"
msgstr ""
"The notification center shows four counts at the top: ``All Notifications``,"
" ``Unread Notifications``, ``Important Notifications``, and ``Important``. "
"Below are filters ``Type``, ``Category``, and ``Status``."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:26 6282c33e32e644608b8696050b332930
msgid ""
"主体是通知列表表格，列包含 ``状态`` ``标题`` ``类型`` ``分类`` ``发布 时间``。每行右上角的圆形按钮可用于标记已读/未读。"
msgstr ""
"The main area is a notification table with columns ``Status``, ``Title``, "
"``Type``, ``Category``, and ``Published Time``. The round button at the top "
"right of each row marks read/unread."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:33 314b9d0ccd3b497690f98b573d2ae570
msgid "通知中心"
msgstr "Notification Center"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:33 a99015447e0b43199ade93a904f3ff4d
msgid "通知中心页面，显示通知列表与筛选条件。"
msgstr "Notification center page showing the notification list and filters."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:36 404e6421c397405685660e4f8773b640
msgid "查看通知详情"
msgstr "View Notification Details"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:38 31f26ee9a88e4739a1f2938b7c01e0d5
msgid "在通知列表中找到需要查看的通知行。"
msgstr "Find the notification row you want to view in the list."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:39 59b1e12235bd4c4390b9148669812a71
msgid "点击通知标题行展开详情（如页面支持）或查看完整描述。"
msgstr ""
"Click the notification title row to expand details (if supported) or view "
"the full description."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:40 4a5138e3d65b4156b2439581d9813ddc
msgid "点击右侧圆形按钮将通知标记为已读，状态从 ``未读`` 变为 ``已读``。"
msgstr ""
"Click the round button on the right to mark as read; status changes from "
"``Unread`` to ``Read``."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:43 ccc17e24064b4549a1387a67248e84cf
msgid "筛选通知"
msgstr "Filter Notifications"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:45 bc2f35552b264aa98de38c8ce66aa406
msgid "在 ``类型`` 下拉框中选择通知类型（如 ``系统通知``）。"
msgstr ""
"In the ``Type`` drop-down, select a notification type (e.g. ``System "
"Notification``)."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:46 ebccd5712e9e4583a30a2ad66278fa7c
msgid "在 ``分类`` 下拉框中选择分类。"
msgstr "In the ``Category`` drop-down, select a category."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:47 b3a9156771304d7cbd2e720981c794db
msgid "在 ``状态`` 下拉框中选择 ``已读`` 或 ``未读``。"
msgstr "In the ``Status`` drop-down, select ``Read`` or ``Unread``."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:48 ebd8f2c3bc98468584f010b897cc1bb0
msgid "列表自动刷新显示符合条件的通知。"
msgstr "The list refreshes automatically to show matching notifications."

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:51 51f1d91b64134c97a669afdaf5d68eed
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions"

#: ../../docs/faq/notifications.rst:53 6d8ba4b1ff764b338abedafd29450e3b
msgid "**没有收到通知怎么办？** 检查通知中心 ``全部通知`` 列表确认是否已发布；如确认未收到，请提交 工单联系管理员。"
msgstr ""
"**Did not receive a notification?** Check ``All Notifications`` in the "
"notification center to confirm it was published. If you still did not "
"receive it, submit a ticket to contact an administrator."
